> Deakin University Melbourne Australia has recognised[ Institute] of Certified Management Account[ants] of Sri Lanka (C[MA] Sri Lanka)[ Professional] Program Foundation and Operational Level for credit transfer to the second year of Deakin University M300 Bachelor of Commerce Degree program.
