IF[AC] is comprised of over 175[ members] and associates[ in more than 130] countries and jurisdictions, representing almost 3 million accountants[ in] public practice, education, government service, industry, and commerce. C[MA] Sri[ Lanka] is also a member of the South Asian Federation of Account[ants] (SAFA) and the[ Confederation] of Asian and Pacific Account[ants] (CAPA).
